    "description": "The FOT can specify project planning zones for designated areas in order to keep land free for future railway installations and systems. No constructional changes that contradict the purpose of the project planning zone may be made in these areas. Project planning zones are valid for five years, with the possibility of an extension. The FOT has not yet made use of this tool. As a result, no content and no minimal geodata model are available for this data set. The metadata set serves solely as a description of the Feature Service for the corresponding level in the cantonal PLR-cadastre.",
